Teste de backup e recuperação — NexUs-DB
Data: 2026-10-19 11:57:48 -03
Ambiente: PostgreSQL isolado de teste (16.15 (Ubuntu 16.15-0ubuntu0.24.04.1)). O banco 'nexus' é uma cópia de
teste com migrations V1-V9 + dataload; nenhum banco compartilhado foi usado. Credenciais via variáveis de ambiente.

=================== 1. Estado do banco de origem antes do backup
$ psql -d nexus -c "SELECT (SELECT count(*) FROM profile) AS profile, (SELECT count(*) FROM payment) AS payment, (SELECT count(*) FROM pantry_item) AS pantry_item, (SELECT count(*) FROM food) AS food, (SELECT count(*) FROM auditoria.log_alteracao) AS auditoria, (SELECT count(*) FROM daily_active_users) AS dau, (SELECT count(*) FROM catalogo.coluna) AS catalogo"
 profile | payment | pantry_item | food | auditoria | dau | catalogo 
---------+---------+-------------+------+-----------+-----+----------
     643 |     598 |         670 |  560 |      1241 |   0 |      327
(1 row)

=================== 2. Backup (formato custom, comprimido)
$ time pg_dump -d nexus -Fc -Z 6 -f nexus_backup.dump

